1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:05,324
Ask an AI a legal question, and it will
give you an answer. Confidently.

2
00:00:05,664 --> 00:00:07,440
But the law changes.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:12,644
This paragraph said a service agreement
had to run at least six months.

4
00:00:12,984 --> 00:00:15,744
Until February, when that floor was
deleted.

5
00:00:16,084 --> 00:00:18,460
So the right answer depends on when you
are asking.

6
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,296
Most retrieval systems cannot tell you
which one you got.

7
00:00:22,636 --> 00:00:24,412
This one can.

8
00:00:25,272 --> 00:00:29,904
Warrant is a bitemporal retrieval system
over federal employment regulation.

9
00:00:30,244 --> 00:00:34,793
Every paragraph carries two clocks. When
it was the law, and when the system

10
00:00:34,793 --> 00:00:35,764
believed it was.

11
00:00:36,624 --> 00:00:42,600
Ask as of 2024, and the gate admits 9,730
paragraphs.

12
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:46,204
Ask as of today, and it admits 10,007.

13
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,664
Different evidence. Different answer. Both
correct.

14
00:00:50,524 --> 00:00:55,278
The date is not a hint in a prompt. It is
a filter pushed into the query, so

15
00:00:55,278 --> 00:00:57,940
superseded text is never even a candidate.

16
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:05,024
Removing that filter costs 96 points of
wrong-version rate. 220 wins. 0 losses.

17
00:01:05,884 --> 00:01:09,052
And when it is wrong, every stage recorded
what it saw.

18
00:01:09,392 --> 00:01:14,511
So the question is not, why did the model
hallucinate. It is, which stage lost the

19
00:01:14,511 --> 00:01:15,080
evidence.

20
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:18,364
Five components in here ship switched off.

21
00:01:18,704 --> 00:01:23,852
A reranker. An entailment verifier. A
calibrated confidence model. Multi-hop

22
00:01:23,852 --> 00:01:26,048
retrieval. A fine-tuned encoder.

23
00:01:26,388 --> 00:01:30,749
Each one built. Each one measured. Each
one disabled, with the p-value that

24
00:01:30,749 --> 00:01:32,988
decided it sitting next to the switch.

25
00:01:33,848 --> 00:01:37,712
Because measuring something and shipping
it anyway is not engineering.

26
00:01:38,052 --> 00:01:42,852
Warrant. The code, and every measurement,
including the ones that came out negative.
